{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Signal IQ PDF APIs",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "# PDF APIs\n\nAPIs for the Signal IQ PDF Flow - upload a bank-statement PDF, list supported banks, and check upload status.\n\nOn a successful upload you receive an `uploadId` immediately. Persist it - every later webhook for that statement carries the same `uploadId`. Each successful upload creates a **new** `uploadId` and starts a **new** processing job.\n\n## Authentication\n\nPass these headers on every call. Credentials are issued during onboarding.\n\n- `x-client-id`\n- `x-client-secret`\n- `x-product-instance-id`\n\nMissing or invalid credentials return `401` with `auth_unauthorized`.\n\n## Available APIs\n\n- **Upload Statement** - `POST /v1/pdf`\n- **List supported banks** - `GET /v1/pdf/supported-banks`\n- **Get upload status** - `GET /v1/pdf/{uploadId}`\n\n## After a successful upload\n\nThe upload call only accepts the file and returns `uploadId`. Processing continues asynchronously.\n\n- Do not poll this API for parse completion.\n- Wait for lifecycle webhooks on your onboarded webhook URL.\n- See the [PDF Flow](/data/signal-iq/pdf-flow) page for stages, notification schemas, fraud and statement-validation gates, and BSP codes on webhooks.\n- After `INSIGHTS_CREATION_SUCCESSFUL`, use `reportId` with the [report APIs](/data/signal-iq/apis/reports/api-reference) to fetch outputs.\n"
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Upload Statement",
      "description": "Upload a bank-statement PDF and receive an uploadId"
    },
    {
      "name": "Supported banks",
      "description": "List supported bank names for the optional bankName field"
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload status",
      "description": "Fetch status for a previously accepted uploadId"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/pdf": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Upload Statement"
        ],
        "summary": "Upload Statement",
        "description": "Upload a bank-statement PDF as `multipart/form-data`. On success you receive HTTP 202 with `id` (= `uploadId`). Persist it and wait for webhooks. Do not poll for parse completion. Each successful upload creates a new `uploadId` and starts a new processing job.",
        "operationId": "upload_signal_iq_pdf_statement",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-client-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-client-secret",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client secret issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-product-instance-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Product instance identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "file"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "file": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "format": "binary",
                    "description": "Bank statement PDF"
                  },
                  "bankName": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Optional bank name hint (for example, HDFC Bank). Improves detection when provided.",
                    "example": "HDFC Bank"
                  },
                  "startMonth": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Optional statement range hint"
                  },
                  "endMonth": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Optional statement range hint"
                  },
                  "password": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Required only if the PDF is password-protected"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Upload accepted. Processing has started. Persist `id` as uploadId.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "success": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    },
                    "id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uuid",
                      "description": "uploadId - correlate all later webhooks"
                    },
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "status": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "example": "PROCESSING"
                        },
                        "uploadId": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "format": "uuid"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "traceId": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "uuid",
                      "description": "Support / tracing id when present"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "id": "fb12d1a2-1e5c-4c63-aa54-d5f1d2ec19af",
                  "message": "PDF Parser request is being processed",
                  "data": {
                    "status": "PROCESSING",
                    "uploadId": "fb12d1a2-1e5c-4c63-aa54-d5f1d2ec19af"
                  },
                  "traceId": "da8163fe-eeb5-4a2b-857e-a67fdaaecd93"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Upload rejected or client not configured",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "pdf_upload_rejected_bsp_103": {
                    "summary": "pdf_upload_rejected - BSP-103 file too large",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "pdf_upload_rejected",
                        "type": "validation",
                        "message": "upload failed 400: ... BSP-103 ..."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "pdf_upload_rejected_bsp_104": {
                    "summary": "pdf_upload_rejected - BSP-104 unsupported format",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "pdf_upload_rejected",
                        "type": "validation",
                        "message": "upload failed 400: ... BSP-104 ..."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "pdf_upload_rejected_bsp_106": {
                    "summary": "pdf_upload_rejected - BSP-106 password required",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "pdf_upload_rejected",
                        "type": "validation",
                        "message": "upload failed 400: ... BSP-106 ..."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "pdf_upload_rejected_bsp_107": {
                    "summary": "pdf_upload_rejected - BSP-107 wrong password",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "pdf_upload_rejected",
                        "type": "validation",
                        "message": "upload failed 400: ... BSP-107 ..."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "fiu_not_configured": {
                    "summary": "fiu_not_configured",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "fiu_not_configured",
                        "type": "validation",
                        "message": "Client is not onboarded for PDF upload routing"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid credentials",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "auth_unauthorized",
                    "type": "auth",
                    "message": "Unable to authenticate request. Pass x-client-id, x-client-secret, and x-product-instance-id headers correctly."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Empty or missing file",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "api_validation_error",
                    "type": "validation",
                    "message": "file is required and must be a non-empty PDF"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Service misconfiguration",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "config_invalid",
                    "type": "internal",
                    "message": "Service configuration is invalid. Contact Setu support."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Upstream or config temporarily unavailable",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "examples": {
                  "pdf_upload_failed": {
                    "summary": "pdf_upload_failed",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "pdf_upload_failed",
                        "type": "internal",
                        "message": "Upload failed. Retry the request."
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "config_unavailable": {
                    "summary": "config_unavailable",
                    "value": {
                      "error": {
                        "code": "config_unavailable",
                        "type": "internal",
                        "message": "Configuration temporarily unavailable. Retry the request."
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Orchestration temporarily unavailable",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "temporal_unavailable",
                    "type": "internal",
                    "message": "Orchestration temporarily unavailable. Retry the request."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/pdf/supported-banks": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Supported banks"
        ],
        "summary": "List supported banks",
        "description": "List supported bank names you can pass as the optional `bankName` field on upload.",
        "operationId": "list_signal_iq_pdf_supported_banks",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-client-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-client-secret",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client secret issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-product-instance-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Product instance identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Supported bank names",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "data": [
                    "HDFC Bank",
                    "ICICI Bank",
                    "State Bank of India"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid credentials",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "auth_unauthorized",
                    "type": "auth",
                    "message": "Unable to authenticate request. Pass x-client-id, x-client-secret, and x-product-instance-id headers correctly."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/pdf/{uploadId}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Upload status"
        ],
        "summary": "Get upload status",
        "description": "Fetch status for a previously accepted `uploadId`.",
        "operationId": "get_signal_iq_pdf_upload_status",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "uploadId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "The uploadId returned by POST /v1/pdf",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-client-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-client-secret",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Client secret issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "x-product-instance-id",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Product instance identifier issued during onboarding",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Upload status / parse report",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {
                  "success": true,
                  "id": "fb12d1a2-1e5c-4c63-aa54-d5f1d2ec19af",
                  "data": {
                    "status": "PROCESSING",
                    "uploadId": "fb12d1a2-1e5c-4c63-aa54-d5f1d2ec19af"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid credentials",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "auth_unauthorized",
                    "type": "auth",
                    "message": "Unable to authenticate request. Pass x-client-id, x-client-secret, and x-product-instance-id headers correctly."
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Upload not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "error": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "auth",
                            "validation",
                            "internal"
                          ]
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "code",
                        "type",
                        "message"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "error"
                  ]
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": {
                    "code": "api_validation_error",
                    "type": "validation",
                    "message": "uploadId not found"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "code": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "auth",
                  "validation",
                  "internal"
                ]
              },
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "code",
              "type",
              "message"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "error"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
